# 9 downs reach MANAGE CLOUD CONNECTIONS in the CLOUD STORAGE SETUP group (ES d87891f24: BACK UP,
# RESTORE, MATCH, the two sync switches, ACTIVE CONNECTION, CHANGE CLOUD FOLDER
# LOCATIONS, CLOUD FOLDER ACTIONS, CHECK CLOUD SETUP, MANAGE CLOUD CONNECTIONS).
# #1428's evidence: read the row frame first -- a row added above moves the target.
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
